+> docker run -v "$(pwd):/code" -w /code sokrates init
+
+### Landscape
+
+Creates or updates a landscape report, aggregating the analyses found under an analysis root:
+> java -jar sokrates.jar analyzeLandscape -analysisRoot <folder>
+
+`analyzeLandscape` is the landscape counterpart of the analysis commands. `updateLandscape` is the same command under its older name and still works, so existing scripts keep running. Run either with `-help` to see its options.
\ No newline at end of file
